{"code":"LEGION_STATUS_SCOPE_REQUIRED","error":"LEGION-1 is a Legion issue (it, or an issue above it, carries the legion label): a status write needs a credential that holds the person scope or the legion-status scope, and this request's holds neither. An architect of an issue above writes done, backlog, icebox or triage once its claim is ready: its broker token proves its session, and the Legion daemon has published that session as the architect of that issue"}
